<title>PORTUGAL: RALLYING-PORTUGESE RALLY FOURTH STAGE PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-PORTUGESE RALLY FOURTH STAGE PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>FIGUEIRA DA FOZ, Portugal 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading</p>
<p>placings after four stages of the Portugese Rally on Monday:</p>
<p>    1. Colin McRae (Britain) Subaru		 26 minutes 38 seconds</p>
<p>    2. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Subaru	    4 seconds behind</p>
<p>    3. Carlos Sainz (Spain) Ford		     7 seconds</p>
<p>    4. Tommi Makinen (Finland) Mitsubishi	  8 seconds</p>
<p>    5. Freddy Loix (Belgium) Toyota		 25 seconds</p>
<p>	 Rui Madeira (Portugal) Subaru		25 seconds</p>
<p>    7. Richard Burns (Britain) Mitsubishi	 31 seconds</p>
<p>    8. Gregoire de Mevius (France) Ford	   56 seconds</p>
<p>    9. Fernando Peres (Portugal) Ford	     59 seconds</p>
<p>    10. Armin Schwarz (Germany) Ford		 1 minute 31 seconds</p>
</text>
